NG-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">说明：各班随队老师由班主任安排具体任务；（如有特殊情况需要请假，请告知</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">年级</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">考勤</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">人员</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">）</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"> </span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>三、纪律要求及注意事项</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1.活动前，班主任要做好安全教育和调查工作，体质特殊和身体不佳的学生，不宜参加。参加和不参加的学生都要填写好“申请书”（“申请书”由班主任保存）。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2.出发前以及返回学校，班主任都要组织专人清点人数；班主任活动中要随带家长联系电话，保证紧急情况下的即时联系。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3.活动须知：</span></p><table style="MARGIN-BOTTOM: 0.001pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none" uetable="null"><tbody><tr class="firstRow" style="HEIGHT: 0.32in"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 76.75pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: #d7d7d7; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>须知事项</strong></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 409.7pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: #d7d7d7; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>须知内容</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 1.85in"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 76.75pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: #d7d7d7; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: