pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>，不得将手、头伸到窗外，以免发生意外；</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>强调这一天活动中都是乘坐同一辆车，让学生记住车牌号，也不要随意更换座位！</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3.行车过程中，强调行车安全和徒步安全，强调时间观念、纪律观念、卫生意识。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">晕车的</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">同学</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">请提前做好相关准备，报备</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">老师</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，索要晕车药及垃圾袋，并调换至合适座位</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 1.59in"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 76.75pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: #d7d7d7; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>安全须知</strong></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 409.7pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">活动期间</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">每一位学生都必须服从教官和老师的</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">管理</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">任何人不得脱离队伍单独行动！</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">如有特殊情况请及时向班主任老师说明！</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2.活动过程中，任何人员</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">身体如有不适，请及时告知</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">班主任老师、跟队教官。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3.为了个人安全，严禁携带</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">任何易碎、尖锐物品；</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">活动前</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">请</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">将指甲剪短，以免在</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">活动</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">过程中造成</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">意外伤害和</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">不必要的损伤</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">。</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 0.52in"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 76.75pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: #d7d7d7; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>着装须知</strong></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 409.7pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">统一穿着学校配发的校服、运动鞋或适合运动的平底休闲鞋，带好防晒帽（为避免被山中的虫蚊叮咬，建议穿着长衣、长裤）</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 1.76in"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 76.75pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: #d7d7d7; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 108%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>携带物品温馨提示</strong></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 409.7pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>准备一个小书包或背包，携带好以下物品：</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1.水杯（出发前请装好温水或常温水，不建议凉水、冰水）</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2.准备午餐（简单便捷的食品为主，建议面包、饼干等，</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>不建议携带自发热或是其他含汤水的食品</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">）</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3.根据个人需求携带纸巾等个人用品；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 125%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">4.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>班级携带垃圾袋，严禁乱扔垃圾。</strong></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 1.72in"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 76.75pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: #d7d7d7; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 9.6pt 0px 0px; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>其他事项</strong></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; WIDTH: 409.7pt; VERTICAL-ALIGN: middle; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 5.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.4pt"><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>徒步过程中全程无卫生间，只有起点（锁泗桥）、终点（平水中学）有卫生间</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">，届时教官会组织安排。但是由于学生人数众多，为了避免厕所拥堵，造成行程延误，</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>务必要求学生在上车前必须解决好上厕所问题。</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 19.1pt 0px 0px 0.5in; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2.据预报活动当天气温较高，为了保障学员安全，请班主任老师提前对学生做好心理建设，</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>请所有学生提前做好防暑防晒准备工作。</strong></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: black; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">（可根据个人需求，携带防晒霜、皮肤衣）</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"> </span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong> </strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"><strong>四、学生安全要求</strong></span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1.遇到困难，及时联络。</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">高一</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">带队领导：俞奇弘（</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">9296280</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">）</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">杨佩琼（9299153）</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；王月琴</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">（9299137）</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；何隽豪（9292077）；高二带队领导：孙洪亮（9286655）；钟慧军（9299073）；</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">周文龙（9299234）</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">医务：</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">范国娟（9299021）；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">2.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">每位学生统一穿校服，选择合适</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">的</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">运动鞋；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">3</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.每位学生固定座位，来回位置不得更改，方便点名；系好安全带，车上不得自行走动，不得将手、头伸到窗外，以免发生意外；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">4</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">.遵守纪律，做到一切行动听指挥。严禁擅自离开队伍独自行动，不大声喧哗，原则上行进途中不允许上厕所，如特殊情况需请示并与同学结伴去</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">5.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">注意路途安全，不追逐打闹，不到危险地带活动（如山边、悬崖边等），行进间注意防止滑落路边的山沟，不做危险游戏。穿越、行进公路时，听从指挥，统一要求，确保交通安全</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">6.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">同学之间相互照顾，注意安全，看管好私人物品</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">7.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">师生一律严禁携带火种（打火机、火柴等）进入林区，确保林区安全</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">8.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">爱护一草一木，不攀、不折、不摘、不踩</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">9.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">爱护环境，不丢不留垃圾。各队要准备清洁袋，徒步中回收本队的垃圾</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">10.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">不经允许不得在路边摊点购物，并注意食品安全（注意生产日期）</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">11.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">出发前保证充足的睡眠，确保精神及健康状况良好。不得空腹或饱腹，以便有充足的体力</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">；</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">12.</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">每次上车必须点好名，不得缺人；下午返程时，人齐的班级先发车。</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"> </span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px"> </span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">                                                   </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">德育处</span></p><p style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN: 0px 0px 0.001pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">                  </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">                                </span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">202</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">1</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">年</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">5</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">月</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">12</span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Calibri; COLOR: #000000; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; PADDING-TOP: 0px; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px">日</span></p>
    
